                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='30819' id='20' type-v2='text' w='26624' x='72908' y='68288'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontsize='12'>Recomendations:</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontsize='12'>Churn rate drastically increases for new customers when the monthly charges were high. A customer srated with teh company longer, they were likely to churn as prices increases.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontsize='12'>We recomend bringing on new customers as well as converting mnthly customers on yearly basis.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
